<title>USA: TABLE-TNP Enterprises Q2 shr $0.56 vs $0.71.</title>
<headline>TABLE-TNP Enterprises Q2 shr $0.56 vs $0.71.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
